@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Development Reflection";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="card shadow-sm rounded-lg">
        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
            <h3 class="mb-0"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i> My Development Reflection</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <p>
                Throughout this activity, I enhanced my skills in developing with ASP.NET Core MVC. I focused on improving the project's structure by organizing logic, views, and scripts separately to increase clarity and maintainability. Additionally, I worked with layout pages and partial views to minimize duplication and maintain a consistent design across the app.
            </p>

            <p>
                On the front-end, I explored Bootstrap utilities to enhance responsiveness and visual appeal, and integrated interactive features like alerts, collapsible panels, and enhanced form elements to create a more seamless user experience. I also honed my use of model binding and view models to manage data more effectively between the controller and views.
            </p>

            <p>
                This project boosted my confidence in combining server-side logic with dynamic front-end interactions, emphasizing the importance of clean architecture and user-centered design. In the future, I plan to incorporate asynchronous operations with AJAX, refine validation processes, and implement advanced UI/UX strategies to make applications both functional and visually engaging.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
